            <span class="v2-help-route-link">추천 학습 순서 보기 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
          </a>
          <a class="v2-help-route-card" href="#device">
            <span class="v2-help-route-icon" aria-hidden="true"><img src="assets/icons/volume-up.svg" alt="소리와 화면" width="26" height="26"></span>
